    "$t": "<p>&nbsp;</p><p></p><h1 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: x-large;\">《重逢大稻埕》</span><span style=\"font-size: large;\">/</span><span style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">陳錦月</span></span></h1><div><span><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; font-size: xx-large; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEhFlmwPL0K9n19aN9h_bHH4zuupohtpl7sIgfGDpBSeN_xnaU4KXgN11uMkIklo1OD1VqOQEUcC8MI3G8m2TUuowavxhVS4aL7SH3ccv928qYvdtahRDE5MsNb4nWMY5A6WjWQYy07ttTmMXzVRlTR73T2SonIlzPrnMngP4pa8F9XOU-iBBIruWRjOxkWD\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEhFlmwPL0K9n19aN9h_bHH4zuupohtpl7sIgfGDpBSeN_xnaU4KXgN11uMkIklo1OD1VqOQEUcC8MI3G8m2TUuowavxhVS4aL7SH3ccv928qYvdtahRDE5MsNb4nWMY5A6WjWQYy07ttTmMXzVRlTR73T2SonIlzPrnMngP4pa8F9XOU-iBBIruWRjOxkWD\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEiEsLw6ZCFg8bChQjPuJjX5qRNWZkfg_wvT_ZKiZnRLqn7w62pLYaRZb3IDvs91DwMN4LMK0zM5_MFc807zLnGuek1OQNUkY6fv1GMaLi1kvjXk0ehAEmThXwM67TZJHDtQABVjuiOoh00XIIwd6TGcw_by1mf1jktLUgHoIAjRDQgYmGcwpNgs8JC1bpey\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEiEsLw6ZCFg8bChQjPuJjX5qRNWZkfg_wvT_ZKiZnRLqn7w62pLYaRZb3IDvs91DwMN4LMK0zM5_MFc807zLnGuek1OQNUkY6fv1GMaLi1kvjXk0ehAEmThXwM67TZJHDtQABVjuiOoh00XIIwd6TGcw_by1mf1jktLUgHoIAjRDQgYmGcwpNgs8JC1bpey\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEi2dE5zb7-w1PTQrNUXICsJgbuf8pmiiS2IzOrb3UbeUfMWdbH9e1Udh8xgYWzCh2xiGmrFhxpp_37YVyo7htOrAXcpoRcmGWEjWdBd_oXql7N61FTzXVCVjJMRQcJ4zMUa1vwYFM88YIR4VOB1Qat2jXZy4q0IdLwsTYvRiEchQU-Zk8DiQGyQv111aouV\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEi2dE5zb7-w1PTQrNUXICsJgbuf8pmiiS2IzOrb3UbeUfMWdbH9e1Udh8xgYWzCh2xiGmrFhxpp_37YVyo7htOrAXcpoRcmGWEjWdBd_oXql7N61FTzXVCVjJMRQcJ4zMUa1vwYFM88YIR4VOB1Qat2jXZy4q0IdLwsTYvRiEchQU-Zk8DiQGyQv111aouV\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEj-IuK6edttoRbn-uEVyjOb7HXIIojSE5vlOP4CagKzELh00FdPYYtZqKao7pUAcHeM-QpOh7hrqOAmHg_kAoR9UpHCZL-uBYka9jM6oQhV6xyaah30qP_a1LmanaH-LCtxyEs2XMwkzHzEJ9xaKRjVy1cTu_yrhwXpx1WfdHUhZuyiOyK769nqMddx-Dd-\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img data-original-height=\"1518\" data-original-width=\"1075\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEj-IuK6edttoRbn-uEVyjOb7HXIIojSE5vlOP4CagKzELh00FdPYYtZqKao7pUAcHeM-QpOh7hrqOAmHg_kAoR9UpHCZL-uBYka9jM6oQhV6xyaah30qP_a1LmanaH-LCtxyEs2XMwkzHzEJ9xaKRjVy1cTu_yrhwXpx1WfdHUhZuyiOyK769nqMddx-Dd-=w453-h640\" width=\"453\" /></a></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEhcSYgC9JJyRr-ybWNePS2Z2nmf8buLV4rcNdbsWYJeZE7suS3XuL0CVhYopCSZBhn8R-sJyW0TMgDyr_Fma-H-KAABef4j3b9pfwiFt25FMZL7D26pt1Q3j4lNPUUcb12nWhUQlIpKTV96AX5EMGuuOxGp66jizvm4nWxz9I4LFwcF64vZS_FF1ImKrK1b\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img data-original-height=\"3036\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEhcSYgC9JJyRr-ybWNePS2Z2nmf8buLV4rcNdbsWYJeZE7suS3XuL0CVhYopCSZBhn8R-sJyW0TMgDyr_Fma-H-KAABef4j3b9pfwiFt25FMZL7D26pt1Q3j4lNPUUcb12nWhUQlIpKTV96AX5EMGuuOxGp66jizvm4nWxz9I4LFwcF64vZS_FF1ImKrK1b=w453-h640\" width=\"453\" /></a></div><br /></div></div></div></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; font-size: xx-large; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">來台北，bih蹛厝內兩工無踏出大門，下早仔，囡仔講beh駛車載我去陽明山行行se̍h-se̍h--leh，沿路車輛真濟。去到位，停車場lóng客滿，後生放阮落車，駛去揣停車位，我kah兩个查某囝，ná行ná等in阿兄。就準講炎天赤日頭熱kah hông走無路，出來tsia運動ê人mā bē少。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">囡仔知影我跤頭趺無好，揀一條有樹仔ńg ê小路，無疑悟行到半中站拄著kuân落崎，一坎一坎ê石gîm仔，兩爿無khînn無khi̍t，我一手khiú查某囝ê手股頭做枴仔huānn，行kah規身軀重汗。看著面頭前一个量約80 thóng歲鐵骨仔生ê阿伯，kōo一个人一步一步liú-lia̍h peh tsiūnn崎kah阮sio閃身 ，hōo我tsiok欣羨，伊有tsit-lō勇跤，百面m̄是三兩工訓練--出-來--ê。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">來到二子坪步道，路m̄-nā平thánn，景色mā有夠suí，tsiok適合老大人kah囡仔一家伙仔來tsia行跤花。倚12點，阮來天母一間蚵仔麵線店食晝，就準講疫情iáu未完全消退，點菜mā koh ài排隊！內面用餐ê人客mā bē少，有人包--起-來紮走。阮母仔囝隨人點一碗蚵仔麵線kah四神湯，腹肚款飽，直接駛車往迪化街布市仔，揣阮beh愛ê布料。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">到永樂市場peh樓梯起去二樓，看tsiok濟店面ê鐵門thuah--落-來，tsiah想著今仔日是禮拜日無營業。阮tī四箍圍仔se̍h一輾，想起íng過我tī tsia行踏幾若年，tsit-má suah感覺有一點仔生份，人行tī巷路，東西南北suah分bē啥清楚，一時揣無tú-tsiah tsiūnn樓梯ê所在，kám講是siunn久無來，iah是食老無頭神--ah！</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">Iáu ē記得20 thóng冬前，逐禮拜ê拜二下晡，我tio̍h uì新北市盤兩幫公車，來迪化街畫會kah劉秀美老師畫圖。教室原底tī永樂市場五樓，同學ê年歲，uì正十歲ê囡仔人到kah 80外歲ê老大人，其中有三份一是大稻埕在地人。有tang時仔上課煞，阮一phâng人ē suà攤去「賣麵炎仔」點心擔食烏白切，了後tsiah去甘谷街同學in兜看電影，iáu ē記得tī hia看過一齣電影，叫做《Carmen》（『卡門』）。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">畫會後--來徙去西寧北路大稻埕偶戲館1林董--ê提供ê教室。同學內底有小游in爸仔囝黨，kah施媽媽母仔囝黨，lóng蹛tsia附近。小游80幾歲ê老爸，阮lóng稱呼伊「少年游--ê」。施媽媽hām少年游--ê真好客，三不五時ē邀請阮tsit陣同學下課了去in兜。去到位，游媽媽款一桌phong-phài ê料理，有台北圓環上kài有名ê芋仔蝦捲，有芋仔椰子奶西米露suà喙尾；施媽媽in兜ê白tsām雞kah施爸爸親手做ê菜頭long仔，lóng是in ê手路菜。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">想--啊想，拄想kah神--去，後生ná pué手機仔行倚來講：「阿母，我tshuā lín去食tsia上kài有名ê『幸福甜品』茶米露。」大漢查某囝隨應講：「我知--lah，芋仔西米露內底ê芋仔khiū koh好食，阮學校老師bat團購叫外送。」</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">離開永樂市場車駛出迪化街正uat，沿路來到西寧北路大稻埕偶戲館，我講：「20外冬前，tsia親像阿母ê灶跤。」阮kā車停路邊，uì邊--a tsit條巷仔行--入-去，遠遠就看著『幸福甜品』ê招牌，我徛店頭前，蹛亭仔跤sīm一tak久仔，tng我ê跤踏tsiūnn店面gîm-tsînn，hiàng時ê記憶就一幕一幕浮tī目睭前。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">店內tng-leh無閒招呼人客ê小游，一下攑頭看著掛喙am ê我，聽著聲就隨叫出我ê名。阮坐--落-來，ná食ná hām小游開講十thóng分鐘，koh注文三杯芋仔西米露、兩杯茶米露、十粒半熟卵，hōo小游ke送兩粒半熟卵。Tsit擺後生查某囝鬥陣tshuā我重逢大稻埕，hōo我有滿滿ê幸福。</span></div></div><div><br /></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEheiPHFkAqGShp9loyQMHLNVr2XP3eL2YQrCvRqi2OhNHXdITg1lxY85CLb_i7X7KqFMdAAtvs_y18hNW6KhS8u2K-07F6HFpJ5R-G3S_JDT57qpf3tszsERaP1wzHewE3ccUJwLuN6ugYeGLt8bKAtxl6BeernGPRv5vdRD0cTG8JmI-k7jApdtgCDytGX\" style=\"background-color: white; font-family: arial; font-size: large; margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em; text-align: center;\"><img data-original-height=\"729\" data-original-width=\"512\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEheiPHFkAqGShp9loyQMHLNVr2XP3eL2YQrCvRqi2OhNHXdITg1lxY85CLb_i7X7KqFMdAAtvs_y18hNW6KhS8u2K-07F6HFpJ5R-G3S_JDT57qpf3tszsERaP1wzHewE3ccUJwLuN6ugYeGLt8bKAtxl6BeernGPRv5vdRD0cTG8JmI-k7jApdtgCDytGX=w451-h640\" width=\"451\" /></a></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></div></span><span><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span></div></span><div><h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><